<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <p>
    A site responded to the takedown notice we sent for <strong><%= @product_name %></strong>.
    Their response is below.
  </p>
  <%= simple_format(@report.counter_notice_body) %>
  <p>
    <% if @report.counter_notice_received_at %>
      The site received this response on
      <strong><%= @report.counter_notice_received_at.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %></strong>.
    <% end %>
    The page can come back <strong>10 to 14 business days</strong> after the site received it,
    unless you file a court action and tell the site's agent about it. If you want to pursue this,
    talk to a lawyer before that window closes.
  </p>
  <p>Reply to this email if you have questions.</p>
</div>
